              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *kaccēri*, once more]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "innale rātri ñaṅṅaḷ oru saṁgīta kaccērikkŭ pōyi. — Last night we went to a music concert.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *innale rātri ñaṅṅaḷ oru saṁgīta kaccērikkŭ pōyi.* — Last night we went to a music concert.]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
