          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വാദ്യം — vādyaṁ — \"a musical instrument\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഉത്സവത്തിന് പല വാദ്യങ്ങൾ ഉണ്ടായിരുന്നു. utsavattinŭ pala vādyaṅṅaḷ uṇṭāyirunnu. There were many instruments at the festival."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: വാദ്യങ്ങൾ, vādyaṅṅaḷ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വാദ്യോപകരണം is the full formal word for a musical instrument."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വാദ്യം (vādyaṁ) is borrowed from Sanskrit vādya, \"to be played\", and as a noun \"instrumental music\" (CDIAL 11511)."
            }
          ]
        },
